{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function convertSchemaToJsonSchema(schema, options?): JSONSchema | undefined;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/tools/schema-converter.ts#L349","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/tools/schema-converter.ts:349"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Converts a Standard JSON Schema compliant schema or plain JSONSchema to JSON Schema format\ncompatible with LLM providers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Supports any schema library that implements the Standard JSON Schema spec (v1):"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Zod v4+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ArkType (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Valibot (via "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toStandardJsonSchema()"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@valibot/to-json-schema"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If the input is already a plain JSONSchema object, it is returned as-is."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"schema","children":[{"type":"text","value":"schema"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/SchemaInput.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SchemaInput"}]},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Standard JSON Schema compliant schema or plain JSONSchema object to convert"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ConvertSchemaOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Conversion options"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/JSONSchema.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"JSONSchema"}]},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"JSON Schema object that can be sent to LLM providers"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Using Zod v4+ (natively supports Standard JSON Schema)\nimport * as z from 'zod';\n\nconst zodSchema = z.object({\n  location: z.string().describe('City name'),\n  unit: z.enum(['celsius', 'fahrenheit']).optional()\n});\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(zodSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using ArkType (natively supports Standard JSON Schema)\nimport { type } from 'arktype';\n\nconst arkSchema = type({\n  location: 'string',\n  unit: \"'celsius' | 'fahrenheit'\"\n});\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(arkSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using Valibot (via toStandardJsonSchema)\nimport * as v from 'valibot';\nimport { toStandardJsonSchema } from '@valibot/to-json-schema';\n\nconst valibotSchema = toStandardJsonSchema(v.object({\n  location: v.string(),\n  unit: v.optional(v.picklist(['celsius', 'fahrenheit']))\n}));\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(valibotSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using JSONSchema directly (passes through unchanged)\nconst rawSchema = {\n  type: 'object',\n  properties: { location: { type: 'string' } },\n  required: ['location']\n};\nconst result = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(rawSchema);","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"schema","text":"schema","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction convertSchemaToJsonSchema(schema, options?): JSONSchema | undefined;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/tools/schema-converter.ts:349](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/tools/schema-converter.ts#L349)\n\nConverts a Standard JSON Schema compliant schema or plain JSONSchema to JSON Schema format\ncompatible with LLM providers.\n\nSupports any schema library that implements the Standard JSON Schema spec (v1):\n- Zod v4+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- ArkType (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- Valibot (via `toStandardJsonSchema()` from `@valibot/to-json-schema`)\n\nIf the input is already a plain JSONSchema object, it is returned as-is.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### schema\n\n[`SchemaInput`](../type-aliases/SchemaInput.md) \\| `undefined`\n\nStandard JSON Schema compliant schema or plain JSONSchema object to convert\n\n### options?\n\n`ConvertSchemaOptions` = `{}`\n\nConversion options\n\n## Returns\n\n[`JSONSchema`](../interfaces/JSONSchema.md) \\| `undefined`\n\nJSON Schema object that can be sent to LLM providers\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\n// Using Zod v4+ (natively supports Standard JSON Schema)\nimport * as z from 'zod';\n\nconst zodSchema = z.object({\n  location: z.string().describe('City name'),\n  unit: z.enum(['celsius', 'fahrenheit']).optional()\n});\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(zodSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using ArkType (natively supports Standard JSON Schema)\nimport { type } from 'arktype';\n\nconst arkSchema = type({\n  location: 'string',\n  unit: \"'celsius' | 'fahrenheit'\"\n});\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(arkSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using Valibot (via toStandardJsonSchema)\nimport * as v from 'valibot';\nimport { toStandardJsonSchema } from '@valibot/to-json-schema';\n\nconst valibotSchema = toStandardJsonSchema(v.object({\n  location: v.string(),\n  unit: v.optional(v.picklist(['celsius', 'fahrenheit']))\n}));\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(valibotSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using JSONSchema directly (passes through unchanged)\nconst rawSchema = {\n  type: 'object',\n  properties: { location: { type: 'string' } },\n  required: ['location']\n};\nconst result = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(rawSchema);\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: convertSchemaToJsonSchema\ntitle: convertSchemaToJsonSchema\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction convertSchemaToJsonSchema(schema, options?): JSONSchema | undefined;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/tools/schema-converter.ts:349](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/tools/schema-converter.ts#L349)\n\nConverts a Standard JSON Schema compliant schema or plain JSONSchema to JSON Schema format\ncompatible with LLM providers.\n\nSupports any schema library that implements the Standard JSON Schema spec (v1):\n- Zod v4+ (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- ArkType (natively supports StandardJSONSchemaV1)\n- Valibot (via `toStandardJsonSchema()` from `@valibot/to-json-schema`)\n\nIf the input is already a plain JSONSchema object, it is returned as-is.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### schema\n\n[`SchemaInput`](../type-aliases/SchemaInput.md) \\| `undefined`\n\nStandard JSON Schema compliant schema or plain JSONSchema object to convert\n\n### options?\n\n`ConvertSchemaOptions` = `{}`\n\nConversion options\n\n## Returns\n\n[`JSONSchema`](../interfaces/JSONSchema.md) \\| `undefined`\n\nJSON Schema object that can be sent to LLM providers\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\n// Using Zod v4+ (natively supports Standard JSON Schema)\nimport * as z from 'zod';\n\nconst zodSchema = z.object({\n  location: z.string().describe('City name'),\n  unit: z.enum(['celsius', 'fahrenheit']).optional()\n});\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(zodSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using ArkType (natively supports Standard JSON Schema)\nimport { type } from 'arktype';\n\nconst arkSchema = type({\n  location: 'string',\n  unit: \"'celsius' | 'fahrenheit'\"\n});\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(arkSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using Valibot (via toStandardJsonSchema)\nimport * as v from 'valibot';\nimport { toStandardJsonSchema } from '@valibot/to-json-schema';\n\nconst valibotSchema = toStandardJsonSchema(v.object({\n  location: v.string(),\n  unit: v.optional(v.picklist(['celsius', 'fahrenheit']))\n}));\n\nconst jsonSchema = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(valibotSchema);\n\n@example\n// Using JSONSchema directly (passes through unchanged)\nconst rawSchema = {\n  type: 'object',\n  properties: { location: { type: 'string' } },\n  required: ['location']\n};\nconst result = convertSchemaToJsonSchema(rawSchema);\n```\n"}
